  "en": "80C Telok Blangah Street 31"
 },
 "description": "Well-maintained: The flat is kept in clean, move-in condition. The layout is simple and practical, so you won't need to spend much on major renovations.\n\nBright and windy: Being up on the 18th floor, the unit gets plenty of breeze and great natural light throughout the day, without getting hit by the hot afternoon sun.\n\nUnblocked view: You get a nice, open view with lots of privacy, as the unit doesn't face directly into any neighbouring blocks.\n\nSuper convenient location:\n• Just a short 8 minute walk to Telok Blangah MRT, 12 minutes walk to Labrador Park MRT\n• 1 hawker centre, 3 coffee shops, 24-hour NTUC, clinics, general amenities all within 5 minutes walk.\n• Bus stop 2 minutes walk away that brings you to HarbourFront MRT in less than 10 minutes. \n• 5 minutes walk to major bus stop along Telok Blangah Road.\n• Close to the Southern Ridges and Mount Faber if you like nature walks.\n\n\nKEY POINTERS for BUYERS\n1. Near Labrador / Telok Blangah MRT (Circuit line) wet market and hawker centre.\n2. ⁠High floor, lift level\n3. Serious Seller. Price negotiable\n4. Eligible to All Races.\n\n[Our Agent Fees] \n$1999 to Sell HDB\n$4999 to Sell Condo\n$9999 to Sell Landed\n\nWith over 200+ Transactions in the last few years, we will be glad to assist. Drop Us a WhatsApp for a viewing or for more info for our services!",
