     "jobTitle": "HomeUp Co-Founder",
     "description": "Tong Boon focuses on helping HDB owners and home buyers make clear, well-timed decisions as they move up the property ladder.\n\nComing from a humble background, he started working at 15 and paid his way through university, an experience that shaped his practical and disciplined approach to money and long-term planning. He later graduated from the National University of Singapore with a Degree in Real Estate (Honours, Distinction), combining real-world perspective with strong professional fundamentals.\n\nIn 2024, Tong Boon transacted over 100 properties in a single year, spanning HDB, condominium and landed homes.\n\nToday, he co-leads the Upgrading Division, working closely with HDB upgraders and home buyers. His approach is straightforward and client-first: clear planning, honest advice, and a fixed-fee model that makes professional guidance accessible without compromising on quality.\n\n• National University of Singapore | Real Estate (Hons) Distinction\n• NUS Top 5% Public Speaker (2021)\n• Assisted over 300+ HDB, Condo and Landed Clients\n• Associate Chief Director @ C&H Properties Pte Ltd",
